$ enola providers --help
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
Usage: enola providers <list|fetch> [name]

The fact providers this binary carries itself.

  list         name each built-in provider and whether it is ready
  fetch <name> download the pinned engine library of a built-in provider,
               verify its published digest, and cache it. After
               `fetch rubydex`, a `providers:` entry named rubydex with no
               command runs in-process. The only network access a provider
               ever makes, and never at snapshot time.

Built-ins: rubydex

Exit codes:
  0  listed, fetched, or already installed
  1  the download or its verification failed
  2  the command could not run

Examples:
  # Which built-in providers are ready
  enola providers list

  # Download and verify the Rubydex engine library
  enola providers fetch rubydex
